  "compassHelpContent": "1. Allow location access when prompted so the compass can calculate the exact geodesic direction and distance to the sacred site.\n\n2. Select your desired Buddhist pilgrimage site or enter a custom destination.\n\n3. Hold your phone flat (parallel to the ground) and slowly turn your body until the needle points straight ahead.\n\n4. When aligned on target, the compass glows vibrant gold and the banner confirms you are facing the site.\n\n5. Tap the Globe icon in the top app bar to view the interactive flight path map. Tap the mini-compass on the map to switch back.\n\n6. Enable Vibration for haptic pulses that notify you when you are on target.\n\n7. Pay respect, chant, or meditate facing the sacred Bodhi Tree or pilgrimage site.",
