  "vitDWeekInfoTitle": "About the weekly total",
  "vitDWeekInfo": "Vitamin D is stored in the body for weeks, so a sunny day can cover a cloudy one. This card adds up the last 7 days (fewer if you started recently) and compares it with 7 days of your daily target.\n\nEach day can count for at most 3 days' worth, so one big session cannot cover the whole week.\n\nNever stay out longer to catch up. The sunburn limit is always per day. To make up for missed days, uncover more skin or lie down on the next sunny day instead.\n\nIf the week stays low, consider vitamin D–rich food or a supplement.",
